        "cooked": "<p><span>Handelabra Games is once again looking for Beta Testers! This time around, we are primarily looking for testers to help with&nbsp;</span><strong>Bottom of the 9th</strong><span>. If you have experience beta testing other games, have experience in game development, or are even just really excited to help make&nbsp;</span><strong>Bottom of the 9th</strong><span>&nbsp;the best it can possibly be, we’d love to have you on the home team!</span></p><p>Find out more and sign up here:&nbsp;<span>http://handelabra.com/beta</span></p>",
